    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Studio Dumbar (now STUDIO DUMBAR/DEPT) is a Rotterdam-based visual identity and motion studio, founded 1977 by Gert Dumbar in The Hague, relocated to Rotterdam in 2003. Third creative director Liza Enebeis has led since 2011. Acquired by DEPT in 2016; now operates as a distinct studio within the DEPT network (approx 34-36 staff, 11-40 bracket per PitchBook/RocketReach). Capabilities span visual identity systems, motion design, creative coding, sound design, and brand strategy. Notable clients: Dutch Police (1993), Dutch Railways, Instagram, OpenAI, Utah Jazz, Van Gogh Museum. Founded DEMO, the world largest design-in-motion festival. European Design Awards Agency of the Year 2023.",
      "source_url": null,
      "verified_at": "2026-07-06T00:38:11",
      "set_by": "agent"
    },
